        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>WESTWARD</strong> sea-ward, i.e., toward the Mediterranean (Deuteronomy 3:27).",
        "Easton's Illustrated Bible Dictionary, M. G. Easton (1897). Public domain.",
